    "起个喜欢的名字，换上喜欢的颜色，让星星、花瓣或猫猫圈住今天。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Choose a title and colors you love, and mark today with a star, blossom, or little cat."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "好きな名前と色を選んで、星や花びら、猫で今日を囲もう。"
